<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Chip hover and frontmost highlighting now sits behind the app name only, not behind the icon, and the highlight is shorter.</li>
    <li>Idle chips draw no fill or border, so the bar reads as icons and labels instead of a row of pills.</li>
    <li>The chip row starts further from the bar's left edge, so the first icon no longer bleeds into the rounded corner.</li></ul>
<p class="footer">DockishOS 0.026</p>
